{
  "*sigh* I can't believe we're going to\\nMementos even though it's a holiday...": "",
  "It has to be done, Motoha. This is our duty\\nas Phantom Thieves, after all.": "",
  "Hoo. As you are all aware, some strange\\nchanges have been occurring within\\nMementos...": "",
  "There is ample precedent for such problems\\ncausing an effect on reality, as well.": "",
  "Therefore, we must conduct a routine patrol\\nof Mementos and confirm any signs of such\\ndisturbances.": "",
  "I don't think this'll solve all our\\nproblems... but it beats sittin' round doin'\\nnothin', at least.": "",
  "I get that... but why do we have to do it on\\nour day off?": "",
  "Well, we all tend to be busy after school,\\nand it's hard to get everyone together.": "",
  "We don't know when our schedules will next\\nalign, so I believe it's best to do this\\nwhile we can.": "",
  "I wanted a day off too...": "",
  "Riko's right.": "",
  "Ugh... I can't argue with that. If {{A}}\\nsays so too, I guess I've got no choice.": "",
  "All right, let's just get in there and get\\nthis over with!": "",
  "By the way, Shun... why are you in your\\nuniform on a holiday?": "",
  "Huh? Well, Katayama-san was sayin' that back\\nin the day, students always wore their\\nuniforms when they went out...": "",
  "Are you serious!? Today's a day off, right!?\\nYou've gotta wear your own clothes on a day\\noff!": "",
  "Who asked you? I'll do whatever I want!": "",
  "For what it's worth, school regulations\\nencourage students to wear their uniforms\\nwhen going out, even on holidays.": "",
  "It's not compulsory, but as the disciplinary\\ncommittee chair, perhaps I should also be in\\nuniform today...": "",
  "Whaaat? You're way too serious, Riko. I don't\\nthink anyone sticks to school rules like\\nthat. Besides Shun here.": "",
  "Hoom... Your distinct lack of caution is\\nconcerning.": "",
  "In case you have forgotten, Mementos remains\\na dangerous place where Shadows lurk.": "",
  "If you make one wrong step, your very life\\ncould be in danger, yes?": "",
  "No, I didn't forget... It's just that we've\\ngone there so many times, I'm kinda used to\\nit by now.": "",
  "Yeah. I was plenty nervous the first time we\\nfired up the Meta-Nav, but not these days.": "",
  "Right? Back then, I never knew what was gonna\\njump out at us in there...": "",
  "But I don't think anything would surprise me\\nanymore.": "",
  "Same.": "",
  "That's why I fear your familiarity may lead\\nto carelessness...": "",
  "Let's put it aside for now, Lufel. I\\nunderstand your concern, but...": "",
  "We've gained experience, and going into\\nbattle with a calm mind is certainly not a\\nbad thing.": "",
  "If anything happens, I'm here.": "",
  "Don't worry about them.": "",
  "Right. Perhaps I went too far. I apologize.": "",
  "It's fine, it's totally fine! I know you\\ndidn't mean anything by it.": "",
  "Yeah, people do say it's dangerous to get too\\ncomfortable... I'll be sure to keep that in\\nmind.": "",
  "Well, I think that settles things. Now then,\\nLeader, shall we?": "",
  "1st Anniversary": "",
  "Okay, let's get to it. How do we wanna split\\nup the teams, Leader?": "",
  "Flip a coin?": "",
  "I'll let Wind choose.": "",
  "Understood. Let's consider everyone's\\nindividual abilities while maintaining a\\nbalance of combat power.": "",
  "All right, Wind! Thanks so much!": "",
  "Now that the teams are decided, next we must\\nchoose where to investigate. Last time, we\\nwere...": "",
  "Wait. I'm detecting Shadows. They're\\napproaching our position.": "",
  "Hoo... How many?": "",
  "I'm picking up two... no, three. But they\\ndon't seem terribly strong...": "",
  "I'll trust Wind's judgment, then. Let's turn\\nthe tables on 'em!": "",
  "Wh-Wh-Wh-What the hell!?": "",
  "They're so bright! I can hardly look at them!": "",
  "Weren't you just saying that nothing would\\nsurprise you anymore...?": "",
  "This appears to be a type of Shadow we've\\nnever encountered before... Everyone, on your\\nguard!": "",
  "These Shadows are fine.": "",
  "If it isn't Besa's favorite challenger! Your\\ntiming couldn't be besa!": "",
  "Huh? What? What're they talking about?\\nWonder, do you... know this Shadow?": "",
  "Besa is Besa! Besa the besa the Metaverse!": "",
  "Besa the besa the... what? I'm having trouble\\nkeeping up... Is Besa his name?": "",
  "I suppose you could call it... branding?": "",
  "Could someone tell me what's goin' on? Wonder\\nand Cattle, are you two friends with this\\nShadow?": "",
  "I wouldn't go that far... but they're not an\\nenemy.": "",
  "Besa has been looking all over for you,\\nchallenger! Come with Besa!": "",
  "Wait just a moment. What on earth is this\\nabout? Has some sort of disturbance occurred\\nin Mementos?": "",
  "Oh, it's nothing of the sort! But Besa\\nrequires the challenger's assistance!": "",
  "Assistance?": "",
  "Please tell me what's going on...": "",
  "Of course, Besa will explain all the bes-ics.\\nBut it's too dangerous here.": "",
  "Besa knows a much besa place where we can\\ntalk safely! Come with Besa!": "",
  "What is this guy talkin' about...? He'd besa\\nstart makin' sense, or...": "",
  "Soy! Now you're doing it too!": "",
  "Wha—!? I didn't even notice!": "",
  "We'd besa follow Besa.": "",
  "We'd better follow them.": "",
  "If you say so, then it's probably safe...\\nOkay, got it!": "",
  "Barely started our patrol and we're already\\ngettin' dragged into somethin' weird...": "",
  "All done discussing? Then we besa get a move\\non!": "",
  "Here we are! This place is much besa. Now\\nyou can relax!": "",
  "Wait, no, we're totally surrounded by\\nShadows! How're we supposed to relax!?": "",
  "But... I don't sense any aggressive intent.\\nWhat is all this?": "",
  "These Shadows are merely here to spectate.\\nThey are not our foes.": "",
  "Spectate...?": "",
  "I told everyone about my first\\nmeeting with Besa and how I\\ncompeted in his game show...": "",
  "Shadows producing a TV show for other\\nShadows...? Uhh... I have several\\nquestions...": "",
  "It's not unusual to see Shadows working in a\\nPalace to serve its ruler... so perhaps it's\\nthe same sort of thing?": "",
  "Your guess is as good as mine, but that may\\nindeed be the case.": "",
  "We've visited this particular location a\\nnumber of times, but a Palace ruler has never\\nbeen made apparent.": "",
  "Huh... So these Shadows are just a total\\nmystery then...": "",
  "Hang on, Wonder! You knew about this place\\nthe whole time and never said anythin'?": "",
  "Shun's got a point! Didn't we promise not to\\nkeep anything secret from our fellow Phantom\\nThieves!?": "",
  "...Did we make a promise like that?": "",
  "It was never our intention to hide anything\\nfrom all of you. However...": "",
  "I do apologize for not mentioning this.": "",
  "So... should Besa explain Besa's plan now?": "",
  "Ah, sorry. Go right ahead.": "",
  "Before that, Besa would like to extend Besa's\\nsincerest thanks to you, challenger!": "",
  "After your appearance, ratings have been besa\\nthan ever, and the audience just can't get\\nenough!": "",
  "Which is why for this program, Besa organized\\na special thank-you celebration for Besa's\\nfavorite challenger!": "",
  "A special celebration...?": "",
  "That's right! We call it...": "",
  "The Phantom Thieves' Appreciation Festival\\nMassive Metaverse Bake-Off Celebration!": "",
  "M-Massive Metaverse... Bake-Off...?": "",
  "I... believe that's what they said...": "",
  "Could you be more specific?": "",
  "As the name suggests, Besa will show Besa's\\ngratitude to our challenger with the biggest\\ncake the Metaverse has ever seen!": "",
  "That cake is sure to look great on camera,\\nand we'll be filming every step of the\\nprocess!": "",
  "You're filming this...? You mean, like, for\\nTV...?": "",
  "Not gonna lie, I was on board as soon as they\\nmentioned a huge cake!": "",
  "The name is a bit long... And you called it\\nan \"Appreciation Festival\" and a\\n\"Celebration\"...": "",
  "Isn't that redundant? Those words essentially\\nmean the same thing.": "",
  "Besa thinks it's besa not to worry about it.": "",
  "I get that you wanna make a big cake, but\\nwhaddaya need our help for?": "",
  "How does Besa say this...? Making a massive\\ncake was harder than Besa realized...": "",
  "With the staff's help, we managed to create\\nthe base...": "",
  "...but most of them fainted from exhaustion\\nbefore they could even get started on the\\ndecorations.": "",
  "I suppose that's one way of showing their\\nappreciation...": "",
  "Man, showbiz is brutal, human or Shadow...": "",
  "At this rate, Besa can't finish the show...\\nAnd that's where you come in, challenger!": "",
  "Hoom? What do you mean?": "",
  "Besa made some slight alterations to the\\nproduction script and added audience\\nparticipation!": "",
  "So the Shadows in the audience are gonna help\\nus make this cake?": "",
  "Correct! And that is why Besa needs your help\\nto make this program the besa it can be!": "",
  "With our ever-popular challenger here to\\nspice things up, the audience will surely\\nwant in as well!": "",
  "Okay, I get that part... but you said this\\nwas to show your appreciation for Wonder and\\nthe rest of us, right?": "",
  "So why do we gotta make our own cake? How\\ndoes that make any sense?": "",
  "Well, I am kinda curious about a TV show made\\nby Shadows...": "",
  "...And there's also that huge cake!": "",
  "I suspect one of those things is a greater\\nmotivator than the other...": "",
  "I can't say I'm not curious as well... but I\\nwill leave the decision to our leader.": "",
  "Yeah. I sure as hell don't know the first\\nthing about makin' a TV show, so I'll let you\\nmake the call.": "",
  "If it won't take too long...": "",
  "Ooh... So you accept!? Besa expected nothing\\nless from the challenger!": "",
  "This show is guaranteed to be a smash hit!": "",
  "Now that that's settled, without further\\ndelay...": "",
  "Let the Phantom Thieves' Appreciation\\nFestival Massive Metaverse Bake-Off\\nCelebration... begin!": "",
  "You're really sticking with that name!?": "",
  "Is that SERIOUSLY the besa you could come up\\nwith!?": "",
  "Whoa! Lookin' good so far!": "",
  "Yes... Although it's a really big cake. How\\nmany people do you suppose this would serve?": "",
  "We sure couldn't finish somethin' like this\\non our own...": "",
  "According to Besa, it seems we are currently\\nat around 50% completion.": "",
  "Hoohoo... Once it's done, I believe this cake\\nwill be rather \"lit,\" as they say!": "",
  "\"Lit\"...? Ahahaha! Lufel, where'd you even\\nhear something like that?": "",
  "What's wrong with \"lit\"...!?": "",
  "To be honest, I had my doubts at first, but\\neverything has gone rather smoothly.": "",
  "I know, right? When I heard we'd be on TV, I\\nwas pretty nervous...": "",
  "But it's been so much fun that I completely\\nforgot all about my nerves!": "",
  "The audience response has been quite\\npositive, as well. You seem rather popular\\nalready, Closer.": "",
  "Huh? I-I am...?": "",
  "You ain't doin' too bad yourself, Wind. That\\nbit you did earlier was great.": "",
  "Earlier? You mean the game I played against\\nWonder?": "",
  "Yeah, when you two were competin' to see who\\ncould solve the puzzles the fastest.": "",
  "Oh, yeah, I saw that one too! I had no idea\\nwho was gonna win in the end!": "",
  "It was a super close match! You could tell\\nthe audience was really into it,as well!": "",
  "Really? Well, I'm glad everyone enjoyed it.": "",
  "Let's have a rematch.": "",
  "I won't lose next time.": "",
  "Hehe... I accept your challenge.": "",
  "Hoom... It's good to see you all having fun.": "",
  "Speaking of which... I think Soy has\\nattracted some rather dedicated fans of his\\nown.": "",
  "Seriously? Why would they choose me...?\\nThey're only gonna be disappointed...": "",
  "Challengers! Thank you so much for coming!": "",
  "Hey there, Besa! We're ready to give it our\\nall again today!": "",
  "The pleasure is all Besa's!": "",
  "As you can see, thanks to your efforts, our giant cake is coming along quite nicely!": "",
  "This is the home stretch! Don't give up now!": "",
  "Yeah, we got this. We've made it this far, so we're gonna see it through to the end.": "",
  "That's right. I'm looking forward to seeing the final product.": "",
  "I want to pick out the colors.": "",
  "I want to choose the decorations.": "",
  "Let's make cake ramen.": "",
  "Of course. A colorful cake would look better on TV.": "",
  "What're you lookin' at me for? I don't have a recipe for that yet!": "",
  "...Yet?": "",
  "Besa get ready for our next program! Stay tuned, everyone!": "",
  "Besa seems as busy as ever...": "",
  "Sure does. We've gotta give this our besa—I mean, our best too!": "",
  "Something wrong, Wind?": "",
  "Ah... No, it's nothing important. I just was wondering...": "",
  "Why do you think Besa is so intent on putting this production together?": "",
  "Now that you mention it, it does make me curious... Wonder, do you know anything about that?": "",
  "I dunno.": "",
  "Maybe I do, maybe I don't...": "",
  "Darn... How about you, Cattle?": "",
  "No... I'm afraid I can't shed any light on the matter, either.": "",
  "However, as Besa continues producing this show, more Shadows are drawn to remain in the audience here...": "",
  "...which, I suppose, indirectly prevents desires from being stolen.": "",
  "Huh... So if the show was cancelled, all those Shadows would leave the studio...": "",
  "And they'd just be prowlin' round Mementos like any other old Shadow.": "",
  "Could it be... that Besa is preventing the Shadows from ending up like that?": "",
  "I cannot say for certain. It's possible Besa has no such intentions, and it's merely an unintended side effect.": "",
  "Either way, I believe it's safe to say that Besa's goals are aligned with our own.": "",
  "If that's the case, then we've definitely gotta knock it out of the park!": "",
  "Yes. If we can have fun and avoid combat, I think that's the most ideal outcome.": "",
  "Okay! Let's show 'em how the Phantom Thieves do things!": "",
  "Hoohoo... As seasoned challengers, we can't allow ourselves to be upstaged, Wonder.": "",
  "Everybody worked together to\\nmake the program a success...": "",
  "I can't wait until this giant\\ncake is finally finished...": "",
  "Whoa... It's incredible...": "",
  "Just looking at it makes my mouth water! This\\nis the result of all our hard work!": "",
  "Yes. I'm glad we managed to successfully\\nfinish it.": "",
  "Only one thing left...": "",
  "It's not done yet.": "",
  "That's right! This cake just needs one more\\nthing to make it even besa... Time for the\\nfinishing touch!": "",
  "Finishing touch...?": "",
  "Abesalutely! All this cake needs is...\\ncandles!": "",
  "Now, just stick those candles wherever you\\nlike, and we'll light them all together!": "",
  "Uh... Is it someone's birthday? Why do we\\nneed candles?": "",
  "It's fine. It's besa not to worry about it.": "",
  "Now even Wind is saying it!? I never would\\nhave imagined!": "",
  "Hoo... I don't believe I can reach it on my\\nown. Some assistance, Wonder?": "",
  "Everyone worked together to\\nplace and light the candles...": "",
  "This cake... It's simply... Besamazing!": "",
  "Yes! We did it, guys!": "",
  "I wasn't sure how this was gonna go at\\nfirst... but it ended up bein' pretty fun.": "",
  "I agree. It was quite an unusual experience\\nto be cheered on by Shadows for a change...": "",
  "Now, challengers! As promised, you may enjoy\\nthis cake to your heart's content!": "",
  "Finally!": "",
  "All right, time to dig in! I don't even know\\nwhere to start!": "",
  "Is something the matter, Soy?": "",
  "Well, it's probably a bit late to askin',\\nbut...": "",
  "Is this thing actually... safe to eat?": "",
  "We've got no idea what it's made out of, or\\nif it's even a real cake in the first place.": "",
  "I don't think it's real.": "",
  "Is it a cognitive cake...?": "",
  "Come to think of it, the cake had already\\nbeen made by the time we arrived on this\\nprogram...": "",
  "Supposing this cake is simply a cognitive\\nmanifestation, what would happen if we ate\\nit?": "",
  "Hoom... Frankly, even I could not hazard a\\nguess.": "",
  "I cannot say for certain that it is, strictly\\nspeaking, safe to consume.": "",
  "Maybe we shouldn't...": "",
  "Are we overthinking this?": "",
  "Wonder's right! You're all worrying too much!": "",
  "I understand how you feel, but if there's\\neven the slightest risk, we should abstain.": "",
  "Yeah. If we end up with cognitive food\\npoisonin', we don't even know if regular\\nmedicine's gonna have any effect.": "",
  "Whaaat? Aww, man...": "",
  "It's regrettable, but that's the situation we\\nfind ourselves in.": "",
  "We'll let everybody else enjoy it.": "",
  "We appreciate the gesture.": "",
  "Besa is sorry to hear that...": "",
  "Besa will share this cake with Besa's\\nhardworking staff and lovely audience!": "",
  "Good. We put a lot of love into it, so be\\nsure to enjoy it.": "",
  "But before everyone digs in, let's take a\\nmoment to appreciate all our hard work.": "",
  "*sigh* After all that... I didn't even get a\\nsingle bite!": "",
  "The sight of this giant cake\\nwill be forever engraved in my\\nmemory...": "",
  "Maybe if it was smaller, I\\ncould've at least displayed it\\nsomewhere...": "",
  "Now then, as difficult as it is to say\\ngoodbye, we had best be on our way.": "",
  "I guess you're right. If we stick around any\\nlonger, I'll only be filled with even more\\nregret...": "",
  "Give it up already, would ya?": "",
  "Thank you, challengers! You've made this\\nproduction the besa the best!": "",
  "Hoo... What is it, Wonder?": "",
