  "Such dedication is worthy of recognition.\\nWhat do you say, Leader?": "",
  "I've got no other plans.": "",
  "Time for a cake party!": "",
  "Yesss! So, where should we go?": "",
  "Hold up. Goin' out to eat's fine and all, but\\nhow about we try makin' one ourselves?": "",
  "If we start now, we can probably have it\\nready by tonight. There's a recipe I've been\\nwantin' to try.": "",
  "Okay, but... what kind of recipe? It's not\\ncake ramen, is it...?": "",
  "That's a bit much, even for him...": "",
  "Of course not! It ain't cake ramen...": "",
  "I'm talkin' about ramen cake!": "",
  "That's the same thing! No way! I refuse!": "",
  "It ain't the same thing at all! I'm not\\ntalkin' about a ramen-flavored cake here...": "",
  "It's a ramen-shaped cake!": "",
  "Ramen... shaped...?": "",
  "Yeah, that's right. First, I make the noodles\\noutta—": "",
  "No thanks, that's enough! Just a regular cake\\nis fine! Right, Riko-senpai?": "",
  "Right... Although, I am a little curious\\nabout Shun's idea...": "",
  "Good grief... Always so rambunctious.": "",
  "I like it this way.": "",
  "But it's fine by me.": "",
  "Well, I can't say I dislike it either.": "",
  "In that case, let's have {{A}} decide! Whaddaya say? You up for some ramen cake!?": "",
  "Wouldn't you rather just have a normal cake,\\n{{A}}!?": "",
  "Why don't we have both?": "",
  "Hoohoo... Whatever choice you make here, I\\neagerly await the outcome.": "",
  "I feel like many challenges\\nare still yet to come...": "",
  "But I'll focus on the one\\nright in front of me for\\nnow...": "",
  "We're all here. Is everyone ready?": "",
  "I'm set.": "",
  "Me too! I'm ready to go whenever!": "",
