  "Select 1 (Long press for details)": "",
  "Select <color\\=#ff3b37>Decorate Cake</color>.": "",
  "Use a variety of decorations to create your own original cake.\\nYou can customize the cake's base, borders, decorations, toppers, and candles.\\nSome customizations are only unlocked by progressing through missions in <color\\=#FF423F>1st Anniversary {{A}}</color>.": "",
  "You can place your one-of-a-kind cake in the Thieves Den as <color\\=#FF423F>cake décor</color>.\\nTo receive the cake, you need to meet the daily login requirements for the <color\\=#FF423F>1st Anniversary {{A}}</color> event.\\nPlease note that you cannot change the cake after you receive it.": "",
  "You can also decorate it <color\\=#ff3b37>randomly</color>.": "",
  "Choose a <color\\=#ff3b37>decoration</color>.": "",
  "<color\\=#ff3b37>Save</color> your cake design.": "",
  "Hide scratch-offs in chat after daily limit has been reached.": "",
  "The <color\\=#FF423F>Scratch-Off</color> event is now open!\\nYou can earn <color\\=#FF423F>scratch-off packs</color> from <color\\=#FF423F>1st Anniversary {{A}}</color> missions and Rewind.\\nYou can send scratch-off packs to other players via chat. Each pack contains 1 random scratch-off.": "",
  "<color\\=#FFD145>Event Introduction</color>\\nComplete missions to receive wish candies. As you gain candy, your total on the Mission screen will increase, allowing you to earn rewards. You can also obtain gift wishes and other rewards from 1st Anniversary {{A}}, including event stories. Please note that after you have watched an event story, <color\\=#FFD145>it cannot be viewed again</color>.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Gift Wishes</color>\\nPress the Gift button to select the gifts that you want. To select your gifts, you must first earn gift wishes. These gifts will be delivered to your inbox when the event ends.\\nOnce you have made your wish, it cannot be changed, so please choose carefully.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Decorating Cakes</color>\\nDuring the event, press the Decorate Cake button to design your own cake. Choose the base, piping, decorations, toppers, and candles to create a cake like no other. Your original cake design can be placed in the Thieves Den as a statue. Once completed, the design cannot be changed, so please choose carefully.": "",
  "<color\\=#FFD145>Event Rules</color>\\nDuring the event, you can win presents by collecting scratch-offs. There are 5 kinds of scratch-offs, featuring Lufel, Motoha Arai, Shun Kano, Riko Tanemura, and Shoki Ikenami. You can open 1 present for every 5 scratch-offs you collect. You can also check the list of presents under Rewards. Rewards can also be earned by completing limited-time quests that are available during the event.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Scratch-Off Packs</color>\\nDuring the event, you can send packs to other players via the chat or Companio channel. Each pack contains 1 random scratch-off. You can receive up to 5 packs per day, for a maximum of 40 packs total. Scratch-off-related items will become unusable after the event ends.": "",
  "Anniversary Shop": "",
  "<color\\=#FFD145>Event Rules</color>\\nDuring the 1st Anniversary, a special anniversary shop will be available, featuring special limited-time items that can only be purchased once.": "",
  "Purchase Rewards": "",
  "<color\\=#FFD145>Event Rules</color>\\nBy purchasing items from the Shop during the event, you can obtain Marthym's Stamps. Based on how many of these stamps you earn, you can receive various rewards.\\nPlease keep in mind that your Marthym's Stamp total will be reset after the event ends.": "",
  "<color\\=#FFD145>Event Rules</color>\\nDuring the event, you can open your personalized Anniversary memories.\\nAfter you're done viewing your rewind, you can share your Anniversary memories.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Event Rewards</color>\\nDuring the event, you can obtain event rewards when you view and share your rewind.": "",
  "<color\\=#FFD145>Event Introduction</color>\\nThe special event includes 7 sub-events: Let the Show Begin, Boss Battle, Play That Future Sound, Let the Sound Resound, Perfect Harmony, Missions, and Miku Merch.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Event Duration</color>\\nThis is a limited-time event.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Let the Show Begin</color>\\nEnjoy the collab story.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Boss Battle</color>\\nDefeat the boss to earn rewards.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Play That Future Sound</color>\\nPlay limited-time collab songs.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Let the Sound Resound</color>\\nComplete event goals to earn limited commemorative rewards.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Perfect Harmony</color>\\nLog in daily to claim login bonuses. Rewards will be unlocked sequentially according to your cumulative login days, and rewards for the day will refresh at 8 PM UTC.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Missions</color>\\nComplete set goals to earn a variety of rewards.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Miku Merch</color>\\nTrade Miku Points for a variety of items.\\nWhen the event ends, the Exchange Shop will be closed and all unused Miku Points will be converted into Konpaku Gems.": "",
  "Play That Future Sound": "",
  "<color\\=#FFD145>How to Play</color>\\nWhen you start playing, notes will descend from the top of the screen. Press the notes in time with the line to earn points.\\nYellow notes require a single press, while green notes need to be held down.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Platforms</color>\\nEasy and Hard difficulties can be played with smartphones, PC, and gamepads.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Score</color>\\nThere are four ratings based on timing accuracy: Perfect, Great, Good, and Miss.\\nPlaying in time will continue your combo. The longer the combo, the higher the score for each note.\\nGetting a Miss will break your combo.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Fever Mode</color>\\nAs you continue playing, you will enter Fever Mode.\\nDuring Fever Mode, your score will increase significantly.\\nFever mode will continue as long as your combo is not broken.\\n\\n<color\\=#FFD145>Unlocking Difficulties</color>\\nTo unlock the next difficulty, you need to achieve a B rating or higher on the current difficulty.": "",
  "Let the Sound Resound": "",
  "<color\\=#FFD145>Event Rules</color>\\nDuring the event, if you obtain the new character Hatsune Miku from signing the Chance or Targeted The First Sound from the Future Most Wanted Contract, you can receive rewards for raising her Awareness Level.\\nCertain event missions can only be completed by obtaining Hatsune Miku.": "",
