  "Would you like to stop watching your rewind?\\nYou will be able to watch your rewind again.\\nAfter you've finished viewing, you can share your rewind to receive rewards.": "",
  "r:\"^So far you have forged contracts with <color\\=#FF423F>(\\d+) Phantom Thieves and Phantom Idols</color>\\.\\nAmong them, <color\\=#FF423F>(.+?)</color> have become your most powerful allies, with total ratings of <color\\=#FF423F>([\\d、]+)</color>\\. No matter what dangers may come, you know these allies will have your back\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^In this world where desires have been stolen\\.\\.\\.\\n?you have formed bonds with <color\\=#FF423F>(\\d+) Accomplices</color>\\. Among them, you became <color\\=#FF423F>Close Friends</color> with <color\\=#FF423F>(\\d+)</color> and <color\\=#FF423F>Soulmates</color> with <color\\=#FF423F>(\\d+)</color>\\.\\n?Your deepest bonds are with <color\\=#FF423F>(.+?)</color>\\.\\.\\. forging powerful connections at <color\\=#FF423F>Ranks ([\\d、]+)</color>\\.$\"": "",
  "Strong Enemies": "",
  "r:\"^The Phantom Thieves have fought countless battles against fearsome foes\\.\\nAs of Version ([\\d\\.]+), the most dangerous of these has been <color\\=#FF423F>Shadow Katayama</color>, forcing <color\\=#FF423F>(\\d+)</color>% of Phantom Thieves to succumb to her rage\\.\\nAnd in <color\\=#FF423F>Recollections</color>, when facing <color\\=#FF423F>Shadow Akashi</color> in battle, <color\\=#FF423F>(\\d+)</color>% of Phantom Thieves became part of his gluttonous feast\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^The city is filled with boundless opportunities and experiences\\.\\nAmong the many options for part-time jobs, the crêpe shop proved to be the favorite\\.\\nThe most popular accomplice was (.+?)\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^The <color\\=#FF423F>crane games</color> at the arcades are stocked with plushies\\.\\n\\nThe super rare plushie that was won the most often was the <color\\=#FF423F>(.+?)</color>, with <color\\=#FF423F>(\\d+)%</color> of players hee-ho-owning this plushie\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^You've played <color\\=#FF423F>Tycoon</color> (\\d+) times, and won <color\\=#FF423F>(\\d+)</color> times\\.\\nYou managed to earn a grand total of <color\\=#FF423F>(\\d+)</color> Tycoon Points\\.$\"": "",
  "Awards": "",
  "r:\"^The most discovered award was <color\\=#EF0000>Urban Art Appreciation</color>, found by <color\\=#EF0000>(\\d+)%</color> of players\\.\\nThe rarest award was <color\\=#EF0000>Chirp Chirp</color>, found by only <color\\=#EF0000>(\\d+)%</color> of players\\.$\"": "",
  "P5R Collab": "",
  "r:\"^In the <color\\=#EF0000>P5R event</color>, numerous Phantom Thieves faced off against strong opponents\\.\\n\\nIn battle against <color\\=#EF0000>Dancer of Dreams</color>, <color\\=#EF0000>(\\d+)%</color> of Phantom Thieves rose to victory\\.\\nWhile in <color\\=#EF0000>Monstrous Entity</color>, <color\\=#EF0000>(\\d+)%</color> came out on top\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^On <color\\=#EF0000>Valentine's Day</color>, many players shared special moments with their certain someones\\.\\n<color\\=#EF0000>(.+?)</color> was the most popular, with \\n?<color\\=#EF0000>(\\d+)%</color> of players receiving her special chocolate\\.$\"": "",
  "Thank you for your continued support of Persona5: The Phantom X. We're thrilled to celebrate our first anniversary with you, as we couldn't have reached this milestone without you. We are truly grateful to everyone who has journeyed alongside Wonder and our cast of unique characters, helping bring their story to life.\\nNow, we enter the second year of P5X. Everyone on the team is working hard to deliver an even more fun and exciting experience, so we hope you'll look forward to the future that awaits Wonder and his companions!": "",
  "r:\"^Since you awakened your abilities as a Persona-user on <color\\=#FEC431>([\\d\\/]+)</color>, <color\\=#FF423F>(\\d+)</color> days have passed\\.\\.\\.\\nStill, you continue to fight for a world being sapped of desire, with <color\\=#FEC431>(\\d+)</color> accomplices at your side\\.$\"": "",
